Description: Do not report the first buffer swaps as errors under Wayland
 With the EGL backend wxGLCanvas::SwapBuffers() returns false until the
 compositor signals that the surface is ready, which wx does deliberately
 because presenting earlier can deadlock inside eglSwapBuffers(). The GLX
 backend never returned false, so enabling EGL turns a normal start into
 several logged errors. Report an error only after a frame has actually
 been presented.
